  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The current camera resolution is fine, but the color depth is terrible, causing severe color banding when editing. Also, there is no photography data saved.\n\nPlease add an \"Advanced Camera\" mode with:\n\nHigher Color Depth: 16-bit support for post-processing.\n\nComplete EXIF Metadata: Just like the Polaroid, we need data embedded in the photo (Camera Model, Manufacturer, Aperture, Focal Length, ISO, Exposure, Photographer Name) so editing software can read it.\n\nFormat: RAW or lossless export.\n\nSuggestion: Make it an optional \"Pro\" toggle or require a quick test to unlock it, so it doesn't lag normal players. I am happy to test this on the Beta branch!",
